:: StoryTitle
IAT210: Digital Game Project - Digital prototype handoff


:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "F9C95F53-B21E-467F-983F-A6E7FE3C0580",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Start",
  "zoom": 1
}


:: Aftermath {"position":"600,1000","size":"100,100"}
<<if $built>>
The miners of the underworld are enraged and call for Gurt's retirement.

<<if $pendant>>
Gurt holds up Ulf's pendant in front of the crowd.

<<link "Give an inspirational speech" "Moon">><<set $morale += 5>><</link>>

<<link "Give a speech about power" "Moon">><<set $morale += 5>><<set $defence += 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
Gurt has no pendant. He fumbles a live broadcast and the locals lose faith (Local Morale -2).<<set $morale -= 2>>

<<link "Continue" "Moon">><</link>>
<</if>>
<<else>>
Bandits take a local hostage at a political hearing.

<<if $incision>>
Gurt's cut finger makes him fail the quick draw. The hostage is executed (Local Morale -3).<<set $morale -= 3>>
<<else>>
Gurt quick draws and shoots the bandits (Local Morale +2, Security + Defence +2).<<set $morale += 2>><<set $defence += 2>>
<</if>>

<<link "Continue" "Moon">><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Defence {"position":"600,875","size":"100,100"}
Flash forward. The locals pressure Gurt to set up the planet's defence system.

<<link "Set up the defence system" "Aftermath">><<set $defence += 5>><<set $built to true>><</link>>

<<link "Refuse to set it up" "Aftermath">><<set $morale += 5>><</link>>


:: Ending {"position":"600,1375","size":"100,100"}
<<if $final is "save">>
  <<if $defence gt 7>>Ending 1: Gurt goes mad with control and becomes a recluse with his weapon.
  <<else>>Ending 2: Gurt realizes morale is not enough and reinforces the defences. Radical supporters push him to extremism.<</if>>
<<else>>
  <<if $morale gt 7>>Ending 3: The locals are crushed, but slowly warm back up to Gurt.
  <<else>>Ending 4: The locals are crushed, there are calls for his exile, and Gurt rules with an iron fist.<</if>>
<</if>>

Gurt becomes dictator of T'Chanui either way.

Final Local Morale: <<print $morale>>. Final Security + Defence: <<print $defence>>.


:: Lair {"position":"600,1250","size":"100,100"}
<<if $defence lt 3>>Many locals have been taken hostage.<</if>>

The hideout is crumbling and the villain is escaping. Gurt can only do one thing.

<<link "Chase the Head Bandit" "Ending">><<set $final to "pursue">><</link>>

<<link "Save the locals" "Ending">><<set $final to "save">><</link>>


:: Moon {"position":"600,1125","size":"100,100"}
Local Morale: <<print $morale>>. Security + Defence: <<print $defence>>.

Gurt's military finds the source of the raids: a lone moon. He decides to take the fight there.

<<if $morale lt 3>>There is little support for the mission, and the bandits are notified.<</if>>

<<link "Continue" "Lair">><</link>>



:: Morning {"position":"600,750","size":"100,100"}
Time to leave for the capital.

<<if $ulfAngry>>Ulf is angry and does not say goodbye.<<else>>Ulf says goodbye and tells Gurt she will miss him.<</if>>

<<link "Continue" "Defence">><</link>>


:: Start {"position":"600,500","size":"100,100"}
Dusty wind. Gurt walks into the Shining Star Bar and chats with the bartender about his election as Provincial Minister. Three drunk guys walk in.

<<link "Pick the fight" "Ulf">><<set $defence += 1>><</link>>

<<link "Defuse the situation" "Ulf">><<set $morale += 1>><<set $incision to true>><</link>>



:: StoryInit {"position":"725,500","size":"100,100"}
<<set $morale to 0>>
<<set $defence to 0>>
<<set $incision to false>>
<<set $pendant to false>>
<<set $ulfAngry to false>>
<<set $built to false>>
<<set $final to "none">>


:: Ulf {"position":"600,625","size":"100,100"}
Local Morale: <<print $morale>>. Security + Defence: <<print $defence>>.

<<if $incision>>
Ulf sees the cut on Gurt's finger and worries. Gurt learns she is terminally ill from the mines.

<<link "Rub her back without a word" "Morning">><<set $ulfAngry to true>><</link>>

<<link "Tell her not to worry" "Morning">><<set $pendant to true>><</link>>
<<else>>
Gurt lies to Ulf about the fight and goes to sleep.

<<link "Go to sleep" "Morning">><</link>>
<</if>>
